@0    = ~No!!! You killed him... you killed my beloved one! None of this was supposed to be like this. And I—I should have been here, I should have—saved him.~
@1    = ~I am sorry, my lady. I am sorry, Kwan Ying. You asked me to give myself to compassion; you wanted us not to take part in this war, but now—I have no choice...~